window.products.push({"id":979221,"name":"BingLTD - 6\" Brushed Nickel Metal Sofa Legs - Set of 4 (ML-60T-BN)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415qB5ELBtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About this Metal Leg This Metal Furniture Leg offer a stylish alternative on modern furniture or offer a modern twist to traditional sofas and chairs. This is our new arrival made of heavy duty metal which powerful enough to support your sofas, chairs, wardrobes, cupboards, coffee tables and other furniture. Screw directly to the furniture frame through the hole on the top of the leg. All metal legs come with transparent plastic glides to protect your floor. We recommend a washer with a screw or a bolt for the big hole and either nails or wood screws for the small holes as the small holes are for stabilizing the leg. The dimensions for them are 1/2 inch for the big hole and 3/16 inch for the three small holes. Need Help ? If you have any questions, feel free to contact us before ordering. We will be happy to help! About BingLTD Since 1987 BingLTD has made a conscious effort to be environmentally friendly by utilizing direct extraction of Hevea trees. Hevea is considered one of the most eco-friendly wood sources in the world. These trees are sourced via replanting programs to ensure continuity of supply and preservation of the environment. BingLTD sofa legs can be used with any existing furniture that has legs installed. Whether your need is small or large, with over 65,000 legs in STOCK we have you covered. Use our legs to change the height, style, appearance and feel of your furniture as you see fit. We have more than 80 different legs listed that offer a VARIETY of styles, stain finishes and size options. Just take a look around and imagine the endless possibilities!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415qB5ELBtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BingLTD","source_asin":"B089QT5MXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-979221","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089QT5MXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089QT5MXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
