window.products.push({"id":979234,"name":"VCNY Knights Bridge 12-Piece Queen Comforter Set, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KOJuyXmzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Knights Bridge 12-Piece Comforter Set. Knights Bridge 12-piece comforter set helps you to decorate your bedroom with the most popular bedding items, yet in a quick, convenient and fashionable manner. Included in this collection is a comforter, two pillow shams, two Euro shams, a bedskirt, two decorative pillows and four valances. This collection comes in a popular queen/king size to ensure no member of your family will ever outgrow this bedding ensemble. Knights Bridge 12-piece features golden jacquard scrolling amidst a soft blue background - a color scheme sure to bring out the romantic side in you. Never before has a bedding item provided such as sense of peace and serenity. The two 21-inch by 26-inch pillow shams feature the same blue print found on the 90-inch by 104-inch comforter, while the 26-inch by 26-inch quilted Euro shams are a solid blue color. The bedskirt, which has a 15-inch drop, matches the Euro shams. Knights Bridge 12-piece comforter set also features four 20-inch by 54-inch valances. When shoppers look for bedding, they want a complete collection without the hassle of going from store to store to accessorize. This is what makes the Knights Bridge 12-piece comforter set such a great value. You get not only a complete bedding set but also coordinating window treatments. Knights Bridge 12-piece comforter set is a unique collection of e by citing and very functional bedding items. These features can be found in every item, right down to the beautiful and fun decorative pillows. From jacquard prints and solids to a combination of both, you have it all with the 18-inch by 18-inch square pillow and the 12-inch by 18-inch breakfast pillows that make up this gracious, yet elegant, collection. 100-percent Polyester with polyfill. Machine wash cold, gentle cycle - Do not bleach. Tumble dry low - light iron as needed. Spot clean decorative pillows.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KOJuyXmzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VCNY Home","source_asin":"B005W3EHZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-979234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005W3EHZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005W3EHZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":979235,"name":"Large Red USMC Eagle Globe and Anchor Vinyl Decal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QGs+y4QtL._AC_SL1192_.jpg","description":"Add a little Marine Corps pride to your vehicle with our vinyl Eagle, Globe, and Anchor decals! Our decal measure 10.5 inches wide by 11.5 inches tall. Decals feature an image of the USMC Eagle, Globe, and Anchor. Production time for these decals is 1-3 business days. These decals are die cut from a high quality outdoor grade vinyl. Each decal comes with transfer tape already applied to make application a breeze! Check out our complete line and collect the whole set! Frequently Asked Questions: How long will it take to receive my decals? Typical production time is about 1-3 days. Although we try to get most orders out as early as possible, sometimes, it will take up to 3 days before the order ships. Once it ships, it will take about 3-5 business days to reach you. How do I apply the decal? Each decal comes with transfer tape already applied making it a breeze. Just simply remove the backing from the decal and apply to the surface very gently, smoothing out any air bubbles as you go, then remove the transfer tape from the surface of the decal. Instructions for application are included with your order. ***This Web site is not an official U.S. Marine Corps (USMC) site, however, the owner of this site is an official licensee of the USMC. To reach the official USMC Web site, please go to www.marines.mil","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QGs+y4QtL._AC_SL1192_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Exclusively Your LLC","source_asin":"B01ES0HC4O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-979235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ES0HC4O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ES0HC4O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":979236,"name":"Fire-Arm Guard Gun Safe Dehumidifier, Natural & USA Made Moisture Absorbers from Minerals & Plants - Lifetime Reusable Mini Humidity Pouch for Safes, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IIe-0eSxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEP MOISTURE AT BAY: These gun safe or closet dehumidifier packs are made to get rid of moisture and unpleasant smells using U.S. minerals and plants from tight areas, safes, drawers, storage cabinets, and more to help protect your possessions from dampness, rust, and corrosion LIFETIME QUALITY THAT MATTERS: We make our moisture absorber packs right here in the USA following strict quality control guidelines and carefully chosen materials. They are made for years of use without needing to be replaced monthly as well as being safe for the environment SAFE AND PURE – KID FRIENDLY: Our moisture absorbers for gun safe are made using only natural minerals and plant based ingredients without relying on any harsh chemicals, additives, or artificial ingredients so you can safely use them every day even around kids and pets QUICK AND SIMPLE TO USE: The mini dehumidifier is easy to use as it gets. Simply place it in your gun cabinet, gun safe, ammo pouch, etc. to quickly absorb moisture and odors to keep them safe. You can recharge it by opening the pouch and placing the brick in a sunny place for a few hours for long term use VERSATILE AND MULTI-PURPOSE: Thanks to the lightweight (only 8oz) and portable design, you can easily take these moisture eliminator bags with you on the go making them perfect for use at the gym, hunting trips, camping, fishing, boating, kayaking, sports, and more to absorb moisture from enclosed areas up to 60 cubic feet","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IIe-0eSxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fire-Arm Guard","source_asin":"B09V3DSNFG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-979236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V3DSNFG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V3DSNFG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
