window.products.push({"id":979254,"name":"Annin Flagmakers 196446 Norway USA-Made to Official United Nations Design Specifications, 3 x 5 Feet, Red/Navy/White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sUWY9kzlL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"First adopted in 1821, and with colors believed to have been influenced by France, the United States, and Britain as the colors of freedom, Norway's flag consists of a blue \"Scandinavian Cross\" – indicative of its union with other Scandinavian countries – outlined in white, on a field of red. The vertical stripe of the cross isn't centered but shifted toward the left side of the flag. Family-owned for six generations, Annin Flagmakers takes special pride in producing high-quality, American-made state, international, and military flags. All Annin Flagmakers flags are sewn in either South Boston, VA or Coshocton, OH. Our superior quality is time-tested and meets the requirements of the most discerning buyer. Nyl-Glo, Tough-Tex, and Bulldog are registered trademarks manufactured exclusively by Annin Flagmakers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sUWY9kzlL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Annin Flagmakers","source_asin":"B078VWND96","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-979254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078VWND96","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078VWND96","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
