window.products.push({"id":979630,"name":"rabbitgoo Window Film, 3D Decorative Static Cling Window Privacy Film, No Glue Removable Window Cling, Anti UV Window Tint Film for Home Kitchen, Regu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ThlHtOXtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"UV Blocking, Glare Control: This privacy window film helps resolve many troublesome problems in the hot summer days - it filters strong dazzling sunlight glares, blocks out 84% UVA rays and UVB rays, and protects your skin from harmful radiation exposure as well as reduce the fading and aging of furniture, making your home comfortable to live in Static Cling, No More Glue Hassle: Say goodbye to sticky toxic chemical glue - This 3D glass window film is super static cling and works great on flat, clean, and smooth glass surfaces, leaving no residue after removal and suitable for multiple use; To apply the window film to the window glass successfully, please separate the clear protective backing film from the window film first by sticking a tape to its corner Easy Application, Stylish Decoration: No more heavy curtains or blinds, this window film transforms your personal space at a minimum cost - it can be easily applied in minutes on windows at home, kitchen, living room or office to create a gentle look and high-end style with its special patterns Protected Privacy, Secured Life: This window sticker features decent privacy level 3 Stars- it effectively blurs unwanted outdoor views, offers privacy protection for your home and office to a certain extent, ensuring that your private space is well secured while still allowing softened natural light in More Tips for You: 1. Please spray a lot of water both on the window surface and window film back during installation for effective attachment; 2. The 3D window film itself does not actually have any color. However, with special 3D laser design it will create a colorful visual effect when the sunlight hits the film after the installation","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ThlHtOXtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"rabbitgoo","source_asin":"B00RDVCY9E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-979630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RDVCY9E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RDVCY9E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":979631,"name":"HPD Half Price Drapes Printed Linen Sheer Curtains For Living Room (1 Panel) 50 X 96, SHCH-PS16073-96, SeaGlass Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CnpL4FMmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our linen sheers are both resilient and beautiful and are characterized by an open-weave which allows for the perfect diffusion of light. Made with 100 Percent polyester, they have the look and feel of traditional linen but covet a more elegant drape. This pattern features an abstract geometric print and a calming Seaglass which is sure to freshen any room. As a general rule, for proper fullness, panels should measure 2-3 times the width of your window/opening.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CnpL4FMmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HPD Half Price Drapes","source_asin":"B07HMH7YT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-979631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HMH7YT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HMH7YT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":979632,"name":"Delonghi EC330-s Pump Espresso Maker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eWa806rVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A pump machine is the most traditional and well-known way to make espresso, using the filter holder and ground coffee. The De'Longhi EC330S with professional-level 15 bar pressure offers the ideal introduction to the world of coffee and a hands-on Barista experience in your own home. The EC330S Pump-Driven Espresso Maker, in a stylish brushed stainless steel finish, can be used with both ground coffee and ESE (Easy Serving Espresso) pods for added convenience and makes both espresso and cappuccino. The cappuccino system, based on an in-built manual frothing arm, mixes steam, air and milk to create a rich and creamy froth. The self-priming system keeps the EC330S ready for use at all times. Easy to use, with just three buttons needed for operation (on/off, coffee and cappuccino), this machine has a transparent 1 Litre water reservoir that can be refilled at any time, a stainless steel boiler for longer life and a deep, removable drip tray. The EC33OS also features a cup warmer, built-in coffee tamper, adjustable steam emission and separate thermostats for the coffee and steam.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eWa806rVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"De'Longhi","source_asin":"B000C3MLJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-979632","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000C3MLJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000C3MLJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":979633,"name":"Detroit Artwork by Anderson Design Group, 24 by 32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91WdN2Q1WXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features an illustration of Detroit, MI. Anderson Design Group, Inc. founder Joel Anderson graduated from Ringling School of Art & Design in 1986. He was recruited straight from college to work as a staff illustrator and designer at Carden & Cherry Advertising in Nashville, TN. While at C&C, Joel won an Emmy Award for his work on a CBS show, Hey Vern, It's Ernest. Joel worked at C&C for 7 years, learning the art & science of advertising (and how to talk like Ernest.) In 1993, Joel and his friend David Thomas founded Anderson Thomas Design, Inc. The firm focused on CD package design at first and quickly grew into a diverse print & web design company with a client list that included Universal Studios, DreamWorks Pictures, Golden Books, Thomas Nelson and more. In 2007, the partners decided to pursue different interests, so Joel reorganized the design firm as Anderson Design Group, Inc., narrowing the studio's focus to specialize in illustrative design, branding and product development. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91WdN2Q1WXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00KS4Y1G2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-979633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KS4Y1G2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KS4Y1G2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
