window.products.push({"id":979656,"name":"Personalized Construction Sequin Pillow for Boys, Custom Reversible Sequin Pillow (Black/White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pgvla5EUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Add a fun decorative touch to any room with this PERSONALIZED reversible mermaid sequin pillow! These make great gifts for friends, or just for yourself! Pillowcase is approximately 16\"x16\" reversible sequins with faux suede back.  Text will be printed on white or silver side of sequins, and cropped to fit 13\"x 13\" area on the pillowcase. Text is printed on the white sequin side for the following pillows: White/Silver, White/Black & White/Gold.  PLEASE NOTE: The more letters in your name, the smaller the text will need to be so that your name can fit across the center of the pillow.  Product Care: spot clean only  Package Includes: 1 pillow cover with stuffing added ***FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS*** Why is there white showing around the text/image on my mermaid pillow? Initial printing of the text/image will show the text without a large amount of white in the text. Sequins never go back to the same spot after being moved and swiped, so it's impossible for the text to be completely filled-in after moving the sequins. This can be more easily noticed with photo designs. Why can I see the text/image through the secondary color on my mermaid pillow? Sequins do not lay completely flat so when you are looking at the pillow from below the sequins, you will see the text. Typically this is noticed when you hold the pillow slanted or lay the pillow on a table. Sitting on a couch you will not see as much text/image showing since the eye line is above the sequin. What is your Return Policy? We are a small family business located in Hamilton, OH, so customer satisfaction is important to us! If you have an issue with your product, please contact us so we can assist you or replace your item. We do not accept returns for custom products that are not defective.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pgvla5EUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VeraFide","source_asin":"B07J46FHQQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-979656","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J46FHQQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J46FHQQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
