window.products.push({"id":979844,"name":"【2022 NEW】 Professional Halloween Pumpkin Carving Kit/Pumpkin Carving Tools/Pumpkin Carving Kit with Stencils for Kids&Adults, Stainless Steel with Ha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JFbxcO1yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2022 Upgrade Pumpkin Carving Kit with Stencils】: These pumpkin carving kit with stencils include 1x rubber hammer, 1x pumpkin scoop, 1x double saw tooth, 1x pumpkin needle, and 8x pumpkin carving molds. Pumpkin carving kits are made of premium and sturdy stainless steel, they are very strong and durable after being thickened and upgraded. 【Sharp and Durable Pumpkin Carving Tools】: These pumpkin carving tools are 2 inches in height, thickened, and harder, which are not easily deformed and damaged. Sharp halloween pumpkin carving tools allows you to pierce pumpkins with ease. In addition, our rubber hammer, which will help you save a lot of effort and a ton of time.、 【Safe Pumpkin Carving Kit for Kids&Adults】: The top of the halloween pumpkin carving tools adopt crimping design to protect hands, Children and adults are safer to use and also suitable for beginners or experts in engraving. Use with care when carving halloween pumpkin. Come and carve Jack-o'-lantern with your children. 【Easy to Make Halloween Pumpkin Carving Tools】: Halloween pumpkin carving tools to make your pumpkin look scary and funny! Punch the Pumpkin Carving Kit with Stencils into the pumpkin where you want it to be, then remove excess pumpkin debris and use tools to carve interesting and funny faces into the pumpkin. Different Pumpkin Carving Set can be used to create the various Halloween pumpkin expressions you want. 【Funny Gifts for Halloween Decorations Lantern】: This pumpkin carving kit with stencils comes in a beautiful halloween packaging gift box. It's a perfect gift for halloween decor. When it comes to halloween activities, nothing is more appropriate than taking the time to carve pumpkins. Let's make scary pumpkin lanterns with your family and friends to welcome Halloween!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JFbxcO1yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOWBALA","source_asin":"B0B769FSDX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-979844","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B769FSDX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B769FSDX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
