window.products.push({"id":979975,"name":"Osaka Glass Cold Brew Coffee Maker & Tea Maker - Airtight Seal, 1L / 34oz Glass Pitcher with Removable Stainless Steel Filter - Brew Iced Coffee and T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.63,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BbYsiqqSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY TO MAKE COLD BREW - In just a couple of easy steps you have a full liter of fresh cold-brew coffee brewed in your own home. Just fill the filter with coffee and allow to brew in water 12-24 hrs. AIRTIGHT DESIGN KEEPS BREW FRESH FOR OVER A WEEK - Our designers worked weeks to come with a design that is both pleasing to the eye as well as functional. The specially designed lids keep the extract fresh for more than a week. VERSATILE USE ALLOWS YOU TO BREW HOT OR COLD OR EVEN TEA - Just place tea leaves in the filter instead of coffee and allow to steep. ATTRACTIVE EASY POUR DESIGN - The handle and spout are designed to pour easily without any spills. Will easily fit in your fridge door. QUALITY GUARANTEED - Create a delicious coffee like a pro, with our detailed instructions and tips. For any defects in the materials or craftsmanship of any Osaka product, please contact our customer service team and we will be glad to assist you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BbYsiqqSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Osaka","source_asin":"B01N686ENR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-979975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N686ENR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N686ENR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":979976,"name":"EcoLifeMate Reusable Silicone Food Storage Bags & Scrubber Sponge, Dishwasher Safe, Quart Size (4pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N3KJKxNGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Feeling worried about the millions of single-use plastic zip top bags that end up as waste? We’re here to help! Why choose us: We've continually improved our product throughout its lifetime to meet the needs of customers like yourself. We're very proud to announce that we produce the thickest quality silicone food bags on the market and have engineered the easiest slider bars to open and seal them. Our promise to you is delivering the highest quality product along with unmatched customer experience. What you receive: 4-pack, quart-size reusable silicone food storage bags with easy sliders & scrubber sponge. (1) of each color: White, Blue, Red, Green. Go green, feel amazing: Help the planet and feel great about using the best replacement to disposable zip lock bags. They’ll last you a lifetime. Reduce frustration: Sliding the bar has never been easier with our EZ slider technology. Slide to open and seal from the side with the arrow on the bag only. It is impossible from the other side. This is the single most important tip about the product. Worry-free purchase: Microwave, oven, heat, freezer, boil, sous vide cooking, dishwasher safe. If there's anything at all that concerns you about your new product, reach out to us directly and we'll help. Tips and Tricks - Please wash before first use because of handling and transportation. - Remove the slider bar before any heating, they could melt over 200℉ - It is normal that the slider bar has a bit of resistance near the end of the sealing process, it's what keeps the bag completely airtight. - The front of the bag has a measurement indicator. If you're looking to freeze liquids, do not fill more than the max fill line. - Dishwasher safe. For greasy food, let the bag soak in soapy water first. You can also flip the bag inside out. - BPA-Free and phthalate free food grade silicone. Value the small changes we can make today that impact our children's futures, thank you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N3KJKxNGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ECOLIFEMATE","source_asin":"B078XQWJ12","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-979976","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078XQWJ12","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078XQWJ12","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
